1. Payment of deductible - whether imposed or compulsory as specified in the
Schedule;
2. Any claim arising within 'Time Excess' as specified in the policy schedule;
3. Any loss or damage due to adulterated fuel in any form & usages of non distinctive
fuel as mentioned in the owner's manual;
4. Any repairs/replacement on account of mechanical, electronic or electrical failure
existing before the commencement of Period of Insurance and was made good or
repaired/replaced by the manufacturer and the current event is evident to be arisen
due to the said event irrespective of when the failure actually occurred.
5. Break down due to -
